# ...except the mock coding agent, which components/repomesh-runner/Dockerfile
# installs into the worker image. That Dockerfile also ships its own
# Dockerfile.dockerignore, which BuildKit prefers over this file; this exception
# keeps the build working if the context is filtered by this file instead.
!components/repomesh-runner/mock
!components/repomesh-runner/mock/**
